<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Shell on My Personal Blog</title><link>https://xuxinyi2024.github.io/my-blog/tags/shell/</link><description>Recent content in Shell on My Personal Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://xuxinyi2024.github.io/my-blog/tags/shell/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>one2n Loop Experiment</title><link>https://xuxinyi2024.github.io/my-blog/posts/one2n-experiment/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://xuxinyi2024.github.io/my-blog/posts/one2n-experiment/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Practice the for loop in shell script,printing numbers from 1 to n.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;read -p &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Please enter n:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt; n
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;((&lt;/span&gt;i&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;1;i&amp;lt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;n;i++&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;))&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;do&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; echo $i
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;done&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Shell Script Basics</title><link>https://xuxinyi2024.github.io/my-blog/posts/experiment-2/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://xuxinyi2024.github.io/my-blog/posts/experiment-2/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;In this experiment, I learned how to write basic shell scripts and automate tasks using bash.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>